config QRK3588_GIC_DIAGNOSTICS
	bool "QRK3588 GIC-600 RAS diagnostics"
	depends on ARCH_QRK3588
	depends on DEBUG_KERNEL
	help
	  Read and report the ITS command-queue registers and GIC-600 RAS
	  records after early interrupt controller initialization. Requires
	  firmware to grant Non-secure access to GICT registers. This is
	  intended for controlled bring-up only and must remain disabled in
	  production images.
